<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia April-March budget deficit A$8.933 bln.</title>
<headline>Australia April-March budget deficit A$8.933 bln.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's underlying budget deficit for the 10 months to April, the first 10 months of fiscal 1996/97, was A$8.933 billion, compared with A$12.251 billion in the corresponding period a year earlier, Finance Minister John Fahey said on Monday.</p>
